Challenge 1: The "Digital Receipt" (Memory Management)
In the industry, we rarely just print "Hello World." We process data. This task tests your ability to choose the correct data type for the job (precision vs. memory).

The Task: Create a program that stores and displays details for a high-end electronic item.

Item Name: String

Quantity: int (or short?)

Price per unit: double (or float?)

Is in stock: boolean

Energy Rating: char (e.g., 'A', 'B', 'C')

Implementation Goal: Calculate the total cost (Price × Quantity) and print a formatted receipt.